# Clean Code

- Prefer clarity over cleverness. Use domain names (`Lead`, `Agency`, `assigneeId`).
- Keep functions reasonably small (~40 lines); extract helpers.
- Avoid `any`. Prefer Prisma / Zod inferred types.
- No debug `console.log` in production paths; use Nest logger or remove.
- Do not comment the obvious; document only non-trivial invariants (tenancy, auth).
- Prefer early returns over deep nesting.
- Do not duplicate schemas: put shared ones in `@travelos/shared`.
